																														<td onclick="DownloadOrdJud(this,'V');" data-filename="205400074532025_3.pdf" data-fileyear="2025" data-loc="cishcraj-jdp" style="cursor: pointer;">CRLMP / 7453 / 2025 (MAHAVEER VS STATE OF RAJASTHAN) Date of Order/Judgment: 07/02/2026<br />Petitioner sought quashing of orders directing police &amp; FSL to investigate the matter in a particular manner. HELD- though Court may direct further investigation u/Sec.173(8) CrPC, it cannot control manner of investigation or prescribe mode of collecting evidence, such power lies in exclusive domain of Investigating Agency, Court may monitor but not supervise. Such directions are unwarranted hence set aside to that extent. Petition partly allowed and pending applications disposed of.</td>
